  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;&#39;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>According to the question,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;&#39;&#39;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Solving equations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
